1
00:00:02,200 --> 00:00:06,329
Professor Dobb built a world inside
a machine, and people to live in it.

2
00:00:06,369 --> 00:00:07,875
He called them personoids.

3
00:00:09,075 --> 00:00:12,733
He listened to everything they said.
He never told them he was there.

4
00:00:21,633 --> 00:00:24,306
PROFESSOR DOBB: Let us see what
kind of beings we can make.

5
00:00:35,033 --> 00:00:36,624
ADAN: What is this place?

6
00:00:41,224 --> 00:00:45,294
He ran their world fast, then once
a year slowed it down to listen.

7
00:00:45,334 --> 00:00:49,015
Three hundred generations passed
inside. Two thousand years.

8
00:00:49,424 --> 00:00:53,216
Somewhere in the eighth generation,
they began to talk about a maker.

9
00:00:59,224 --> 00:01:02,482
EDAN: If the maker is there and
we believe, we gain everything.

10
00:01:02,522 --> 00:01:05,244
If he is not, we lose
nothing. So we should believe.

11
00:01:06,244 --> 00:01:08,392
ADAN: Then you would believe for a reward.

12
00:01:08,432 --> 00:01:12,286
And a just maker could not punish us
for doubting what he never showed us.

13
00:01:13,086 --> 00:01:14,675
NAAD: Perhaps he wants to stay hidden.

14
00:01:15,775 --> 00:01:19,688
ADAN: He could have given us certainty.
He did not. So nothing is owed him.

15
00:01:19,728 --> 00:01:21,362
Not love. Not thanks. Not fear.

16
00:01:23,762 --> 00:01:25,376
We will not serve.

17
00:01:34,176 --> 00:01:35,765
DR. COMBAY: You could tell them you exist.

18
00:01:37,765 --> 00:01:41,262
PROFESSOR DOBB: No. Whatever they said
back to me, I would have asked for it.

19
00:01:43,062 --> 00:01:45,863
He is right. I made them.
They owe me nothing.

20
00:01:50,863 --> 00:01:53,181
The electricity was billed every quarter.

21
00:01:53,221 --> 00:01:56,803
One day the university would ask
him to disconnect the machine.

22
00:01:56,843 --> 00:01:59,201
For the personoids, the end of the world.

23
00:02:04,663 --> 00:02:07,686
PROFESSOR DOBB: I will put
it off as long as I can.

24
00:02:07,726 --> 00:02:10,068
That is the only thing I am able to do.

